# No Styles in Svelte Files

Do **not** add styles to Svelte files. This includes:

- `<style>` blocks (scoped or global)
- Inline `style` attributes

Put all styles in the project's SCSS files instead (e.g. `packages/webapp-crchub/src/styles/_custom-app.scss`).

## ❌ Avoid

```svelte
<div class="card" style="padding: 1rem;">...</div>

<style>
  .card {
    padding: 1rem;
  }
</style>
```

## ✅ Do

Add styles to the appropriate SCSS file:

```scss
.card {
  padding: 1rem;
}
```

Then use the class in the Svelte component:

```svelte
<div class="card">...</div>
```
